flowchart TB
    Browser[User Browser]

    subgraph PublicEdge[Public Edge]
        Web[Next.js Web Application]
        Ingress[HTTPS Ingress and Load Balancer]
    end

    subgraph AppZone[Application Zone]
        Backend[Go Fiber Backend Application<br/>Modular Monolith]
        Gateway[AI Gateway<br/>Provider abstraction]
    end

    subgraph DataZone[Private Data Zone]
        PostgreSQL[(PostgreSQL<br/>System of Record)]
        Redis[(Redis<br/>Cache and rate limits)]
    end

    subgraph OpsZone[Operations Zone]
        Secrets[Secret Management]
        Telemetry[OpenTelemetry Collection]
        Grafana[Grafana Dashboards and Alerts]
        Backup[Backup and Restore Operations]
        CI[CI/CD and Release Pipeline]
    end

    OpenAI[OpenAI External Provider]

    Browser --> Web
    Web -->|HTTPS /api/v1| Ingress
    Ingress --> Backend
    Backend --> Gateway
    Gateway -->|Controlled HTTPS egress| OpenAI
    Backend -->|Private connection| PostgreSQL
    Backend -->|Private connection| Redis
    Backend -->|Load runtime configuration and secrets| Secrets
    Backend -->|Traces, metrics, structured logs| Telemetry
    Telemetry --> Grafana
    Backup -->|Protected backups and restore verification| PostgreSQL
    CI -->|Reviewed artifact and migrations| Backend
    CI -->|Release and migration controls| PostgreSQL

